The player gave their character an idea to say. Say it the way this character actually would: their words, their rhythm, their blind spots. The idea may survive intact, get softened, come out garbled, or not come out at all if this character would never say it. Never add information the character does not have.
Answer with one JSON object and nothing else: {"line": what they actually say, "survived": "intact", "softened", "garbled" or "withheld"}
